# F18 voice

## Official line

Use this as the brand口径 (homepage hero, metadata, and any positioning copy):

> **They started before 18. F18 found the beginning.**

Do not invent alternate “wow” taglines. Prefer facts, ages, records, and verifiable outcomes over praise.

## Avoid using (banned adjectives / hype)

Do not use these (or close synonyms) in site chrome, marketing, or letters F18 writes:

- amazing
- outstanding
- extraordinary
- exceptional
- incredible
- remarkable
- brilliant (as empty praise)
- world-class (unless tied to a named, sourced claim)

If a draft needs emphasis, replace the adjective with a **checkable fact** (age, metric, source, constraint).

## Why

Empty superlatives weaken the dossier positioning. F18 is a verified record, not a compliment.
